            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tanaquil"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Update again: If you like SWEETER drinks, use the orange sherbet as Austin suggested. If you like less sweet, more of a sour taste, use the orange juice. I have tried both ways and both are wonderful! Have made this smoothie about 10 times. My 4yo LOVES it! Update: I have made this smoothie several times &amp; we really love it! Today I subbed mandarin orange segments for the oranges and I really like it that way, provided a little extra sweetness. (see posted pics) Thanks, Austin, keep up the great recipe work (: Original review: Very tangy, refreshing! I did add a little sugar to mine. Thanks so much for the post!"
          },
